config FW_CPP
	bool "C++ firmware helpers (fw::)"
	depends on CPP
	default y
	help
	  C++23 helpers under <fw/...>: the fw::Result error model and Zephyr
	  error-code conversions, fw::ChannelRef (typed zbus channels, needs
	  CONFIG_ZBUS), fw::QueueRef, fw::ScopedLock and fw::settings (typed
	  load/save, needs CONFIG_SETTINGS).
